{"title":"God Killer (Job Changing for the Entire Population: The Jobless Me Will Terminate the Gods)","synopsis":"Tahun itu, dunia berubah, permainan menjadi kenyataan dan wabah iblis mulai menimbulkan malapetaka. Untuk melawan semuanya, setiap orang harus memilih kelas mereka dan meningkatkan dengan panik untuk menjadi lebih kuat. Beberapa memilih Master of Law yang mulia, dan memutuskan Elemental Mage untuk giliran kedua mereka. Beberapa memilih Summoner, dengan rangkaian panggilan tak berujung untuk mengumpulkan dan membunuh musuh mereka. Namun yang sangat mengejutkan adalah Yun Chen, seorang yang berprestasi tinggi yang memiliki harapan tinggi, memilih untuk tidak memiliki pekerjaan dan menjadi seorang prajurit tanpa kelas.","alternative_title":"無職だが神を滅ぼした","author":"怪客先生","artist":"漫幽幽工作室","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"f2d09421-51c5-4fc5-9bab-e5835bbbd785","number":"154","title":"Chapter 154","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"id":"5be33b40-51b7-4493-9d28-fdce318a53e3","number":"153","title":"Chapter 153","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"id":"c1753565-b091-463f-a8b5-b3952da3138e","number":"152","title":"Chapter 152","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"id":"85df9a7c-33a7-4613-a9fd-8ec77c11e79a","number":"151","title":"Chapter 151","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"id":"27efd042-5c0c-4601-a772-7bb23647d5b4","number":"150","title":"Chapter 150","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"id":"2e45221f-d14a-4ee9-8783-7d3a9138d029","number":"149","title":"Chapter 149","date":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"id":"b06305b1-a555-4629-be31-814be7cd68d8","number":"148","title":"Chapter 148","date":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"id":"019c93bb-465a-4b27-97cb-d1d677af4efc","number":"147","title":"Chapter 147","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"id":"6d45ad3c-d5e5-4390-b056-31a9d223e31f","number":"146","title":"Chapter 146","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"id":"5520d81e-16b9-46d3-83cc-19ff6588a310","number":"145","title":"Chapter 145","date":"2026-07-